  m_text: "“Yeah, the new guns are nice. Not quite a sidearm, but compact enough to be holstered. I like the feel of it. The recoil is controllable, and having a new gun that still lets us use our existing ammo supply is a nice touch.\r\nI just think it’s a bit much, y’know? I mean, I get that security is being upped and all, but do we really need 30 rounds of 9mm to stop a few rowdy Class-D? Those guys are the main reason we’re armed… right? It's almost as if they have more responsibilities in mind for us now.”\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b40e27b94d22bbf4d8ed598c1c3f329b, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 03c51d5289a83a84f80bbf2ab954cca7, type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
  m_fontMaterials: []
