  m_text: Out of the darkness came a man, covered in death and rotting. Pain and terror were known to its victims, for the strongest walls held no solace. No fortress known to man could impede this creature from dragging its prey into Hell; where hope holds no meaning, and where screaming simply makes the torment worse.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b40e27b94d22bbf4d8ed598c1c3f329b, type: 2}
