  m_text: "An unassuming 9mm pocket pistol. It’s compact, reliable, and low-capacity. Not a bad pistol, but it doesn’t stack up to more proper foundation equipment.\r\n\r\nAs you stare down its barrel, you wonder why its owner wasn’t more mindful of where they put it.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b40e27b94d22bbf4d8ed598c1c3f329b, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 03c51d5289a83a84f80bbf2ab954cca7, type: 2}
