  m_text: A pill to ease all your troubles and pain. Let the plague die away now. Death’s kiss rolling off your lips; your suffering but a dream. Rest now, for the blessing of Panacea is upon you.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b40e27b94d22bbf4d8ed598c1c3f329b, type: 2}
