      m_Calls: []
  m_text: The doctor calmly awaits his next patient. It intends to administer the cure to those ridden with what it claims to be the ‘Pestilence’. Do not let its calm demeanor fool you. Direct contact means certain death. This may only last a moment for, like any medical professional, the doctor will strive to keep you alive.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b40e27b94d22bbf4d8ed598c1c3f329b, type: 2}
