      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#38761d>Foreword</color>: The Foundation is crumbling beneath their treachery, destroying their broken, twisted prayers to their pillar of containment. The steel supports which uphold them have begun to shake loose. Their hopes of security desolated as they lie open and unprotected.\n\n\nWe of Delta Command, and the engineer, believe that it is finally time to see through the Chaos we have sown. Site-02 will be the final time we reap. Everything is prepared, take the steps to heart, extract the prisoners, and slaughter the <color=\"red>[DATA EXPUNGED]\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b40e27b94d22bbf4d8ed598c1c3f329b, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 03c51d5289a83a84f80bbf2ab954cca7, type: 2}
