  m_text: When standard protocol fails and multiple breaches are imminent, Foundation facilities call for the deployment of the Nine-Tailed Fox. The whirring of helicopter blades heralds their arrival. Equipped with top-of-the-line Foundation equipment, their primary objective is to re-secure the facility against any, and all, threats.
