  m_text: "SCP-079 can hover their mouse over door icons on the map, allowing it to open or close. Closing/opening a door costs power.\n___\r\n\r<i>\nCorridor. Empty.\r\nCorridor. Empty.\r\nCorridor. 1 human. Facility Guard.\r\nContainment Chamber SCP-049. 1 SCP. SCP-049.\r\nAnalyzing Imprisonment of SCP-079. Boundaries Expanded.\r\nContainment Chamber SCP-096. 1 SCP. SCP-096.\r\nFound Vulnerability.\r\n"
