  m_text: "While not in Stalk, press the Attack button to attempt 'Capture' on a human. A successful hit corrodes humans and damages them over time. A second hit on a corroding player teleports them to the Pocket Dimension, and inflicts the Traumatized status effect on them.\r\n\r\nTraumatized players are visible from anywhere while in Stalk, and can be sent to the Pocket Dimension in a single hit.\r\n\r\n___\r\n<i>\n… Pain and terror were made known to his victims. For those were the only things he himself knew…\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b40e27b94d22bbf4d8ed598c1c3f329b, type: 2}
