      m_Calls: []
  m_text: “We tested SCP-1576 again for the first time in a while. The anomaly wasn’t really presenting much in the way of new research. Then we noticed that its side effects were starting to take hold quicker. D-02295 was just asking for a sandwich over and over, for about a minute before finally losing consciousness. So, we brought it to Site-02 to figure out why it changed. Juries still out on that one doc.”
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b40e27b94d22bbf4d8ed598c1c3f329b, type: 2}
