  m_text: To unban a player, utilize the text-based <color=#A3CCF3>Remote Admin</color> - <color=#9D9D9D>(At the bottom of the window)</color> And utilize commands <color=#FFF1B8>"unban id Steam64IDHere"</color> OR <color=#FFF1B8>"unban ip IpAddressHere"</color>.
