  m_text: "\r<color=\"red><i>\nServer HCZ-01-A to HCZ-01- K unresponsive, troubleshooting.\r\n12% Files Corrupted. Please run a backup program.\r\nLost Connection to Server Hub. Retrying.\r\nFail (1/3). Retrying.\r\nFail (2/3). Retrying.\r\nFail (3/3). Retrying.\r"
