  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Trigger Stalk to submerge SCP-106 into the ground, allowing him to move undetected at high speeds. \r\nWhile Stalk is active, SCP-106 is imperceptible, moves silently, and is ignored by all Tesla Gates. Trigger the ability again for SCP-106 to re-emerge. \r\n\r\nStalk is fueled by Vigor. While Stalk is active, Vigor is drained. If Vigor runs out, SCP-106 will be forced to re-emerge where he stands. A minimum amount of Vigor is required to activate Stalk.\r\n\r\nWhile in Stalk, SCP-106 can only see humans who are injured, Traumatized, or who're touching him. As a human becomes increasingly injured, SCP-106 can see them from greater distances. Traumatized humans are visible from anywhere.\r\n\r\nSCP-106 passively regenerates Hume Shield while in Stalk. \r\n\r\n___\r\n<i>\nAnd so from the darkness came a man, bringing forth the abyss that swallowed him before…\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b40e27b94d22bbf4d8ed598c1c3f329b, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 03c51d5289a83a84f80bbf2ab954cca7, type: 2}
