  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "SCP-939 <b>steals the last few seconds of speech</b> from its victims, and utilizes various environmental sounds to trick its targets.\r\n\r\nSCP-939 can deploy a <b>mimic point</b> to broadcast its sounds from another location.\n___\r\n\r<i>\n\"In Ancient Aethiopia there was an animal they called the Crocottas or \"dog-wolf\". It is said to mimic the human voice; calling their prey and devouring them. It was faster and stronger than anything commonly known today. I wonder... Has this object really been around for that long?\"\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b40e27b94d22bbf4d8ed598c1c3f329b, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 03c51d5289a83a84f80bbf2ab954cca7, type: 2}
