      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'These convicts, typically on death-row, suffer a grueling fate at the hands of the Foundation. Dressed in distinct, orange jumpsuits, these lower-class personnel have an unrivaled drive to escape. The Class-D are determined to pull through by any means necessary, be that brute force or wits. The  containment breach has given them the opening they''ve been waiting for. '
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b40e27b94d22bbf4d8ed598c1c3f329b, type: 2}
