  m_text: A bladed weapon, similar in appearance to an Indonesian Parang. The object emits a faint, wispy smoke when its ability is available for use. If the blade's ability is active, killing an enemy human with it will cause a player aligned with the user to be resurrected from the enemy's corpse.
