  m_text: "Trigger Blink to catch your observers by surprise and rapidly attack the closest player. Press and hold Blink to have a marker of SCP-173 appear where you are facing. After releasing Blink, SCP-173 will rapidly move towards the marker’s last location, killing the nearest human in range. \r\n___\r\n\r\nSCP-173 has been observed to attack subjects as far as 8 meters away in the span of a second.\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b40e27b94d22bbf4d8ed598c1c3f329b, type: 2}
